/*
 *
 * PLATFORM COVERAGE
 * -----------------
 *
 * Android:
 *
 *   - Fresh installation
 *   - Registration
 *   - Login
 *   - Logout
 *   - Invalid credentials
 *   - Session restoration
 *   - Network failure
 *   - Multiple devices
 *
 *
 * iOS:
 *
 *   - Fresh installation
 *   - Registration
 *   - Login
 *   - Logout
 *   - Invalid credentials
 *   - Session restoration
 *   - Network failure
 *   - Multiple devices
